%% Report and moderation action, as built (FR-MOD, FR-AI)
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Pending: user files report (open, triage pending)
  Pending --> Scored: valid AI suggestion
  Pending --> Unscored: timeout, error, invalid output or restart
  Unscored --> Pending: moderator asks the AI again
  Pending --> Dismissed: moderator dismisses
  Scored --> Dismissed: moderator dismisses
  Unscored --> Dismissed: moderator dismisses
  Pending --> Actioned: hide / remove / notice / mute
  Scored --> Actioned: hide / remove / notice / mute
  Unscored --> Actioned: hide / remove / notice / mute
  Actioned --> Appealed: affected user appeals (once, within 7 days)
  Appealed --> Upheld: different moderator confirms
  Appealed --> Overturned: different moderator reverses
  Overturned --> [*]: content restored / mute lifted
  Upheld --> [*]: removed content purged after 30 days
  Dismissed --> [*]
